1. BASIC HTML CONTE
Payload:
<script>alert(1)</script>

WHERE:
Search box, comments, profile fields.

WHY:
Check whether input is rendered as executable HTML.

EXPECTED:
Browser alert popup if script execution is allowed.


2. IMAGE EVENT HANDLER

Payload:
<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>

WHERE:
HTML body context.

WHY:
Test whether an injected element's event handler executes.

EXPECTED:
Image fails to load and alert appears.


3. SVG EVENT HANDLER

Payload:
<svg onload=alert(1)>

WHERE:
HTML-rendering input.

WHY:
Check whether SVG markup and event attributes are allowed.

EXPECTED:
Alert if browser executes the handler.
